type: software
abstract: >-
  Skein is a local fail-closed swarm control plane with epoch-fenced work,
  late-completion rejection, reusable multi-pass blocks, and tracked
  process-tree termination.
keywords:
  - agent orchestration
  - swarm execution
  - fencing token
  - emergency stop
  - fail-closed
